      "bottomRightY": 174,
      "content": "now be a function of $\\zeta$ as well as $x_1, x_2, x_3, t$. The result of $\\alpha_\\mu$ multiplied into $\\psi$ will be a function $(\\alpha_\\mu \\psi)$ of $x_1, x_2, x_3, t, \\zeta$ defined by",
