      "topLeftY": 790,
      "bottomRightX": 610,
      "bottomRightY": 831,
      "content": "The $\\rho$'s are obtained from the $\\sigma$'s by interchanging the second and third rows, and the second and third columns. We now have, in addition to equations (7)",
